nct_aliases x store). On the production-scale store (5300+ ticket dirs) a single close hung 70+ minutes at high CPU.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- referencing_commits builds an alias index once (single store pass) and threads it into resolve_ticket_id, so the number of full tracker-root scans does not grow with the number of distinct alias trailers in history.\n- Correctness unchanged: same commits credited to the same tickets (full/short/alias/Jira/prefix forms all still resolve identically).\n- A perf-contract unit test asserts bounded store scans for many distinct alias trailers, RED before the fix.\n- No behavior change to resolve_ticket_id's single-id callers (alias_index is optional).\n\nFix: add _ids.build_alias_index + _effective_alias_for_dir (extracted from _scan_alias), optional alias_index param on resolve_ticket_id, build+thread the index in commit_impact.referencing_commits, re-export build_alias_index from _engine_support.resolver.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_ids.py","reason":"add build_alias_index + _effective_alias_for_dir; optional alias_index param on resolve_ticket_id"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine_support/commit_impact.py","reason":"build alias index once and thread into per-ref resolve_ticket_id"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine_support/resolver.py","reason":"re-export build_alias_index"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_referencing_commits_alias_scan_perf.py","reason":"RED perf-contract test for bounded store scans"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"1a0b818c-6872-4e80-a0cd-afcbd26d440e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"4234-821b-150c-461b","ticket_type":"bug","title":"referencing_commits alias resolution is O(distinct_aliases 